OL,3,GNEWSADrink driver guilty of road rage
OL,4,Acyclist murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA drink driver has been found guilty of
OL,7,Fmurdering a cyclist who had clipped the
OL,8,Fwing mirror of his Mercedes.
OL,10,FDavid Morgan, 40, swerved and knocked
OL,11,Fdad-of-three Richard Smith off his bike
OL,12,Fin Chartwell Road, Norwich, on 8 May.
OL,14,FHe had drunk five or six pints at a pub
OL,15,Fearlier that day, then picked up his
OL,16,Fchildren from school, before colliding
OL,17,Fwith 50-year-old Smith.
OL,19,FMorgan, of George Winter Court,
OL,20,FNorwich, had denied the offence during
OL,21,Fa trial at Norwich Crown Court.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
